{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45587","headline":"古意九首 八 · 贯休","name":"古意九首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思李太白，仙笔驱造化。\n玄宗致之七宝床，虎殿龙楼无不可。\n一朝力士脱靴後，玉上青蝇生一个。\n紫皇殿前五色麟，忽然掣断黄金锁。\n五湖大浪如银山，满船载酒挝鼓过。\n贺老成异物，颠狂谁敢和。\n宁知江边坟，不是犹醉卧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}